+loss
+or
+credit
+from such
+activity
+.
+(ii)
+Participation
+as an investor
+—(A)
+In general.
+Work done by an
+individual
+in
+the
+individual
+'s capacity as an investor in
+an activity
+shall not be treated as
+participation
+in
+the
+activity
+for purposes of this section unless
