+An
+individual
+shall be treated as materially participating for a
+taxable year
+in any
+trade or business activity
+of farming if paragraph (4) or (5) of section 2032A(b) would cause
+the
+requirements
+of section 2032A(b)(1)(C)(ii) to be met with respect to
+real property
