+Providing substantial services. If you provide substantial services that are primarily for your tenant’s convenience, such as regular cleaning, changing linen, or maid
+service, you report your rental income and expenses on
+Schedule C. Use Form 1065, U.S. Return of Partnership
+Income, if your rental activity is a partnership (including a
